      "evidence": "The local facts entry says `Conjugate elements in an algebraic closure are related by an automorphism of that algebraic closure ([[cor-conjugate-elements-are-related-by-an-automorphism-of-an-algebraic-closure]]).` But the cited dependency's Statement on disk begins `Assume the Axiom of Choice. Let Ω be an algebraic closure of F ... Then α and β are conjugate over F if and only if some F-automorphism of Ω sends α to β.` The local [L4] drops the Choice hypothesis, and proof step 4.1 cites [L4] without adding that hypothesis, so this is not an accurate restatement of the dependency actually cited.",
